    {
      "id": "pdTHCkgxZInMD-bvmHxRq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 313.44047619047643,
      "y": 527.0000000000014,
      "width": 1677.142857142857,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ff8787",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b69",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1794565728,
      "version": 428,
      "versionNonce": 917237972,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792195380702,
      "created": 1791605798634,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Project Context\n\n- A short description of the project so Claude immediately understands what it is building or\nmodifying\n\nExample:\n\nThis is a FastAPI backend for health-tracking application that stores patient BMI records\nand exposes CRUD APIs.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Project Context\n\n- A short description of the project so Claude immediately understands what it is building or modifying\n\nExample:\n\nThis is a FastAPI backend for health-tracking application that stores patient BMI records and exposes CRUD APIs.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q0Gp0ErEPx9aD8JP4kf1V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 309.15476190476215,
      "y": 982.7142857142869,
      "width": 1677.142857142857,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ff8787",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1511472032,
      "version": 846,
      "versionNonce": 1793565036,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792195380051,
      "created": 1791605995819,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Architecture\n\n- Explains how the codebase is structured and where things belong.\n\nExample:\n\n- Routes live in 'routers/'\n- Business logic lives in 'services/'\n- Schemas live in 'schemas/'\n- Persistence logic lives in 'repository/'\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Architecture\n\n- Explains how the codebase is structured and where things belong.\n\nExample:\n\n- Routes live in 'routers/'\n- Business logic lives in 'services/'\n- Schemas live in 'schemas/'\n- Persistence logic lives in 'repository/'\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UPhDsuaMWrehRILClvpLa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 303.4404761904765,
      "y": 1471.285714285716,
      "width": 1677.142857142857,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ff8787",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1056383584,
      "version": 727,
      "versionNonce": 444301396,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792195378969,
      "created": 1791606188214,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Code style\n\nThis section tells Claude how code should look and what conventions to follow.\n\nExample:\n\n- Use Python type hints everywhere\n- Prefer Pydantic models for request and response schemas.\n- Keep functions small and focused. ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Code style\n\nThis section tells Claude how code should look and what conventions to follow.\n\nExample:\n\n- Use Python type hints everywhere\n- Prefer Pydantic models for request and response schemas.\n- Keep functions small and focused. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gmQOlQIUWYIL9VbBncHBs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 310.5833333333337,
      "y": 1935.5714285714303,
      "width": 1004.2857142857142,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ff8787",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 854897248,
      "version": 1156,
      "versionNonce": 1309862380,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792195378313,
      "created": 1791606427505,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Preferred libraries\n\nConstrains what tools/frameworks should be used.\n\nExample:\n\n- Use FastPI for APIs\n- Use Pydantic for validation.\n- Use SQLAlchemy for ORM\n- Do not introduce new dependencies unless necessary ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Preferred libraries\n\nConstrains what tools/frameworks should be used.\n\nExample:\n\n- Use FastPI for APIs\n- Use Pydantic for validation.\n- Use SQLAlchemy for ORM\n- Do not introduce new dependencies unless necessary ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8L0_GLR4PZTenkWd53wxi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 287.7261904761908,
      "y": 2447.0000000000014,
      "width": 1677.142857142857,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ff8787",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1161104992,
      "version": 1164,
      "versionNonce": 1884558420,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792195370653,
      "created": 1791606593572,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Commands\n\nLists exact commands for running, testing, and maintaining the project.\n\nExample:\n\n- Install dependencies: pip install -r requrements.txt\n- Run dev server: uvicorn main:app --reload\n- Run tests:pytest",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Commands\n\nLists exact commands for running, testing, and maintaining the project.\n\nExample:\n\n- Install dependencies: pip install -r requrements.txt\n- Run dev server: uvicorn main:app --reload\n- Run tests:pytest",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "_aQX9FbL6qf2BUq4LsfDf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 283.44047619047643,
      "y": 2919.857142857144,
      "width": 1677.142857142857,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ff8787",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1040367520,
      "version": 1190,
      "versionNonce": 1795252844,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792195373834,
      "created": 1791606774624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Critical rules\n\nHighlights critical warnings, edge cases, and things to avoid.\n\nExample:\n\n- Do not modify 'database.py' unless absolutely necessary.\n- Patient IDs are provided by the client; do not auto-generate UUIDs. ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Critical rules\n\nHighlights critical warnings, edge cases, and things to avoid.\n\nExample:\n\n- Do not modify 'database.py' unless absolutely necessary.\n- Patient IDs are provided by the client; do not auto-generate UUIDs. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NPmzVvH9DDRiik5DYCo3R",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 286.407983407552,
      "y": 3368.428571428573,
      "width": 634.0007458838752,
      "height": 113.5714285714284,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
